id.instance: String (TS "c<n>")
num.game: i32
num.cursor: u32
map.ordered: IndexMap
bag.data: IndexMap<String, serde_json::Value>
error.style: Result<_, EngineError> with TS's message; panic only on invariants (build_ai_deck panics with TS's message where TS threw; decide, reply and play_match catch_unwind where TS caught)
null.optional: Option + skip_serializing_if
null.nullable: Option, serialised null
case.json: camelCase via serde rename_all
case.rust: snake_case
state.mut: &mut GameState writes, &GameState reads, &mut EngineSink for TS sink mutators (the AI mutates only its own clones: redact, determinize)
rng.source: Rng::new(&state.seed, state.rng_cursor) and write the cursor back (the AI's own streams: AiOptions.rng, Rng::new(seed, 0) for the probe, controller and deck streams)
hook.style: Arc<dyn Fn + Send + Sync> via hook(); no fn pointers, no Box (the AI defines no engine hooks; MatchHooks are Box<dyn FnMut + 'a>)
registry.style: OnceLock set once by register_all; fused scripts built on lookup from state
async.style: tokio in crates/server only; none in pure crates
log.style: tracing JSON to stdout, server only
ai.counter: NodeCounter is a trait (used, limit, take, stopped_by, sim_errors); every search fn takes &mut dyn NodeCounter
ai.simstep: simulate -> Option<Result<GameState, String>>
ai.weights: every AI weight f64, every AI count i32
ai.defaults: TS default parameters are explicit arguments; TS optional parameters are Option
